{"overview":"این مسابقهٔ واقع‌گرایانه تیم‌ها را به سفری دور دنیا به مقاصد شگفت‌انگیز می‌برد تا در چالش‌های ذهنی و فیزیکی شرکت کنند؛ تنها پس از تکمیل وظایف، مکان بعدی آن‌ها مشخص می‌شود و تیم‌های عقب‌مانده به‌تدریج حذف می‌شوند، در حالی که اولین تیمی که به مقصد نهایی می‌رسد، برندهٔ مسابقه و جایزهٔ یک میلیون دلاری می‌شود.","tagline":"","overview_en":"This reality competition sees teams embark on a trek around the world to amazing destinations where they must compete in a series of challenges, some mental and some physical. Only when the tasks are completed will they learn of their next location. Teams who are the farthest behind will gradually be eliminated as the contest progresses, with the first team to arrive at the final destination winning the race and the $1 million prize.","tagline_en":"The world is waiting for you.","runtime":null,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":1,"y":null,"poster":"/wfD2ormxlz2X35QtjCaBcqEVwof.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":13,"y":2001,"poster":"/2GRhG8LSASzV9F1KpXyjsucaCPm.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":11,"y":2002,"poster":"/t6uHOVovIrxDDwMm2e9KLBlH5sX.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":11,"y":2002,"poster":"/dMlduteivxACO4Ubi11roArTYAp.jpg"},{"n":4,"name":"فصل 4","ep":13,"y":2003,"poster":"/sbAgBuJauCLMHVbsPlG8r9RNqiI.jpg"},{"n":5,"name":"فصل 5","ep":12,"y":2004,"poster":"/aF6kJo7e8FO1Sx4b19NiysDKNe3.jpg"},{"n":6,"name":"فصل 6","ep":13,"y":2004,"poster":"/dN865Lh71YNEUjEdYTB5bw6aSdI.jpg"},{"n":7,"name":"فصل 7","ep":12,"y":2005,"poster":"/mmPVidksWVNh57HQV3Z2c1jCDhE.jpg"},{"n":8,"name":"فصل 8","ep":11,"y":2005,"poster":"/12VF3CEbHTPX7hMb4zw2Il4mOxq.jpg"},{"n":9,"name":"فصل 9","ep":12,"y":2006,"poster":"/o6vpuegRzQTHRnxqgsOGSESI72W.jpg"},{"n":10,"name":"فصل 10","ep":13,"y":2006,"poster":"/raWaC3JTxRa2rdOinjGY63URHw3.jpg"},{"n":11,"name":"فصل 11","ep":13,"y":2007,"poster":"/m6dtniFtqr8zpvLlYJl1uCHG3P5.jpg"},{"n":12,"name":"فصل 12","ep":11,"y":2007,"poster":"/5Xy8LtASXn2oTJxjNenEaQ8OMG2.jpg"},{"n":13,"name"